{"data": {"sources": [{"quote": "星桥数据同步服务的常规发布窗口固定在**每周三 02:00–02:30(UTC+8)**。\n窗口期内执行灰度发布:先放量 10% 观察十五分钟,确认同步延迟指标无异常后再全量。", "chunkId": "1e6d4772-d27e-4842-b6a1-7a0046686770", "heading": "1. 发布窗口", "filename": "星桥发布值班手册-20261006.md", "documentId": "f2d5d6d5-0dda-431a-a57a-79a7dcad37a4", "pageNumber": null, "similarity": 0.7224011652466175, "sourceIdentity": {"chunkNo": 1, "charFrom": 124, "filename": "星桥发布值班手册-20261006.md", "projectId": "e4aed8a8-a2c0-4092-a5c8-c96f8650aeac", "documentId": "f2d5d6d5-0dda-431a-a57a-79a7dcad37a4", "charThrough": 212, "parseVersion": "tika-page-clean-v2/chunk-offset-v2", "bodySnapshotId": "5852048f-a27b-439f-9190-35a491e91d06", "offsetCoordinate": "CLEANED_TEXT_UTF16_V2", "embeddingGeneration": "be9b4a5a-a7fe-4a32-bda4-95bb03b80140", "originalContentHash": "df58bc05f100623c5c21051fbae91e01f127fc7314463b62a1fd1dfa91006b2f"}}, {"quote": "发布开始后,如出现同步延迟超过阈值或数据校验不一致,**回滚操作必须在 15 分钟内完成**。\n回滚采用数据库反向补录脚本,由值班工程师执行,回滚结果需在值班日志中登记。", "chunkId": "63432868-8c45-4aa0-80a9-60124e289624", "heading": "2. 回滚时限", "filename": "星桥发布值班手册-20261006.md", "documentId": "f2d5d6d5-0dda-431a-a57a-79a7dcad37a4", "pageNumber": null, "similarity": 0.69879421627694, "sourceIdentity": {"chunkNo": 2, "charFrom": 226, "filename": "星桥发布值班手册-20261006.md", "projectId": "e4aed8a8-a2c0-4092-a5c8-c96f8650aeac", "documentId": "f2d5d6d5-0dda-431a-a57a-79a7dcad37a4", "charThrough": 311, "parseVersion": "tika-page-clean-v2/chunk-offset-v2", "bodySnapshotId": "5852048f-a27b-439f-9190-35a491e91d06", "offsetCoordinate": "CLEANED_TEXT_UTF16_V2", "embeddingGeneration": "be9b4a5a-a7fe-4a32-bda4-95bb03b80140", "originalContentHash": "df58bc05f100623c5c21051fbae91e01f127fc7314463b62a1fd1dfa91006b2f"}}, {"quote": "> 本文档为隔离验收专用测试资料,描述\"星桥\"数据同步服务的发布值班约定。\n> 文档版本:v3.2,生效日期 2026-09-20,责任人:平台交付组。", "chunkId": "a32595b5-26d0-48cd-a408-d54d56fab199", "heading": "星桥数据同步服务 发布值班手册(验收专用 20261006)", "filename": "星桥发布值班手册-20261006.md", "documentId": "f2d5d6d5-0dda-431a-a57a-79a7dcad37a4", "pageNumber": null, "similarity": 0.5959467583816158, "sourceIdentity": {"chunkNo": 0, "charFrom": 34, "filename": "星桥发布值班手册-20261006.md", "projectId": "e4aed8a8-a2c0-4092-a5c8-c96f8650aeac", "documentId": "f2d5d6d5-0dda-431a-a57a-79a7dcad37a4", "charThrough": 110, "parseVersion": "tika-page-clean-v2/chunk-offset-v2", "bodySnapshotId": "5852048f-a27b-439f-9190-35a491e91d06", "offsetCoordinate": "CLEANED_TEXT_UTF16_V2", "embeddingGeneration": "be9b4a5a-a7fe-4a32-bda4-95bb03b80140", "originalContentHash": "df58bc05f100623c5c21051fbae91e01f127fc7314463b62a1fd1dfa91006b2f"}}, {"quote": "灰度观察期间重点盯三项指标:同步延迟 P99、失败重试率、反向补录队列深度。\n任何一项连续两个采样点超标,立即触发回滚流程。", "chunkId": "b5d21480-911e-461c-ab12-4a965a419723", "heading": "4. 观察指标", "filename": "星桥发布值班手册-20261006.md", "documentId": "f2d5d6d5-0dda-431a-a57a-79a7dcad37a4", "pageNumber": null, "similarity": 0.5624013432017353, "sourceIdentity": {"chunkNo": 4, "charFrom": 459, "filename": "星桥发布值班手册-20261006.md", "projectId": "e4aed8a8-a2c0-4092-a5c8-c96f8650aeac", "documentId": "f2d5d6d5-0dda-431a-a57a-79a7dcad37a4", "charThrough": 521, "parseVersion": "tika-page-clean-v2/chunk-offset-v2", "bodySnapshotId": "5852048f-a27b-439f-9190-35a491e91d06", "offsetCoordinate": "CLEANED_TEXT_UTF16_V2", "embeddingGeneration": "be9b4a5a-a7fe-4a32-bda4-95bb03b80140", "originalContentHash": "df58bc05f100623c5c21051fbae91e01f127fc7314463b62a1fd1dfa91006b2f"}}, {"quote": "- 发布窗口值班工程师按周轮值,轮值表由平台交付组维护。\n- 发布放行采用**三级审批**:模块负责人 → 平台交付组 → 值班经理。任一级驳回即中止发布。\n- 紧急修复发布不受固定窗口限制,但需值班经理口头批准并在 24 小时内补记录。", "chunkId": "38187b6b-e122-4748-9542-cb95a5cd6e55", "heading": "3. 值班与审批", "filename": "星桥发布值班手册-20261006.md", "documentId": "f2d5d6d5-0dda-431a-a57a-79a7dcad37a4", "pageNumber": null, "similarity": 0.5151875253729425, "sourceIdentity": {"chunkNo": 3, "charFrom": 326, "filename": "星桥发布值班手册-20261006.md", "projectId": "e4aed8a8-a2c0-4092-a5c8-c96f8650aeac", "documentId": "f2d5d6d5-0dda-431a-a57a-79a7dcad37a4", "charThrough": 445, "parseVersion": "tika-page-clean-v2/chunk-offse